        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192744838.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>打开Analyse（分析）选项卡，使用DataExtract（数据提取）选项，进行分析。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192746266.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192746266.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>由PNG文件头可以看出隐写内容为PNG文件，按save Bin键保存为flag.png文件。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192748185.png">
